 — which is why an international price is not a straight conversion of the rupee one. Delivery usually takes five to ten working days from dispatch, plus whatever customs adds."}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"If your country is not offered at checkout, write to us before assuming we cannot reach it."}]]}],null]}]}],["$","$L2","shipping-metal",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"section-pad-prose wrap-prose text-left ","style":{"backgroundColor":"var(--color-bg)","backgroundImage":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), var(--color-bg))"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-h3 mb-5","children":"Art & Collectibles"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"Metal pieces are crated and insured, and travel more slowly than cloth. Large pieces are quoted individually, because the crate often costs more than the courier."}]]}],null]}]}],["$","$L2","shipping-missed",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"section-pad-prose wrap-prose text-left ","style":{"backgroundColor":"var(--color-bg)","backgroundImage":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), var(--color-bg))"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-h3 mb-5","children":"A missed delivery"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"The courier reattempts, usually twice, then holds the parcel locally for a few days. Tell us rather than the courier — we have the account, and they answer us faster than they answer a consignee."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/pages/contact","className":"cta-link","children":"Write to us"}]}]]}]}]],null]}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/251hl9wif2y5b.js","async":true}],["$","script","script-1",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/0qmvwws_s12e_.js","async":true}]],["$","$L4",null,{"children":["$","$5",n